{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Hetalia: The Beautiful World","They said it couldn’t happen, but they were as wrong as a stack of pancakes in a cage full of bears! The adorable boys of Hetalia are back with some new friends and a super sparkly new look.\n\n\n\nWhat’s more fun than Germany squatting in a dandelion patch? How about the Axis Boys joining the witchcraft club? Or maybe Russia suffering through a traumatic hamster flashback? Any way you slice the spaghetti, every cute boy enjoys a little quality bath time, and Turkey and Greece can’t wait to start splishing and splashing! Fall in love with this new and improved, sparklelicious season of Hetalia as Belgium throws a mouthwatering waffle party, and America shows off his sweet dance moves! We swear you won’t be disappointed – even when Santa Claus goes missing and Canada (who’s that?) tries to replace him with a polar bear! A POLAR BEAR!? Hetalia, you so cray cray. We’ve missed the squee outta ya!\n\n\n\n(Source: Funimation)"],"ja":["ヘタリア The Beautiful World",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[{"id":8479,"relation":"prequel"},{"id":28607,"relation":"sequel"}],"id":"mal-15195","ids":{"shikimori":15195,"mal":15195,"anilist":15195,"kodik":"serial-26068"},"kodikIds":["serial-26068"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-26068":"2020-05-25T08:23:00Z"},"title":"Хеталия: Прекрасный мир","originalTitle":"Hetalia: The Beautiful World","alt":"The Beautiful World Hetalia: The Beautiful World ヘタリア The Beautiful World","description":"Италия , когда-то бывшая сильнейшей империей в мире, изменилась. Это история Италии и её друзей о крайне странных моментах мировой истории.","year":2013,"type":"ONA","genres":["Комедия","антропоморфизм","гэг юмор","исторический","пародия"],"rating":7.42,"popularity":12291,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[8479,28607],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/15195/f81091db8ac01303adc85b3c82b5470b.jpeg","width":710,"height":990},"backdrop":{"url":"https://shik